xamples: Meta Pixel, Google Ads, LinkedIn Insight</span></div>"},{"heading":"4. Managing Your Preferences","content":"<p>You have the right to decide whether to accept or reject cookies. You can exercise your cookie rights by setting your preferences in our Cookie Consent Banner.</p><button class=\\"btn-manage\\" onclick=\\"window.dispatchEvent(new Event('open-cookie-settings'))\\">Manage Cookie Preferences</button>"},{"heading":"5. Contact Us","content":"<p>If you have any questions about our use of cookies or other technologies, please email us at <a href=\\"mailto:privacy@auxosys.com\\" class=\\"legal-link\\">privacy@auxosys.com</a>.</p>"}]}`,
